      "body": "## Motivation\n\nWith prefill CP, `EagerRunner` all-gathers the model output at the end of every forward. For DeepSeek-V4 that output includes `pre_hc_head` (`[tokens per rank, 4 x hidden]`, e.g. `[4096, 28672]` bf16 = 224 MiB per rank on CP4), but when DSpark captures aux hidden states it is dropped right after the gather. It is also above the aiter custom all-gather size limit, so it goes through RCCL. In a DeepSeek-V4-Pro TP4 + prefill CP4 profile on MI355X, the end-of-forward gathers take 5.4 ms per 16K-token forward, and `pre_hc_head` is 80% of those bytes.\n\n## Modifications\n\nDrop `pre_hc_head` before the CP gather when DSpark aux capture is on, instead of after it. The logits processor receives the same inputs as before.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNo numerical change: only a gather whose result was unused is skipped.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nExpected to remove most of the 5.4 ms above per prefill forward with DSpark + prefill CP (the hidden-state gather stays). I will add measurements with DSpark enabled.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [ ] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #39204457295](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39204457295)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #39204457161](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39204457161)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #39204457211](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/39204457211)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
